# An allowlist, because `fly deploy` uploads the whole build context to a remote
# builder: everything is left out unless it is named below, so a database
# snapshot, a token file or .git can't ride along by being forgotten here.
#
# These are everything the image build reads: the manifests for the two install
# stages, the Vite and TypeScript config, the app itself, and the migrations the
# final stage copies. Something new that the build needs (a config file at the
# root, a directory imported from src/) has to be added here as well.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!vite.config.ts
!tsconfig.json
!src
!static
!drizzle
